Egu
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 18 DEAL IVIT
IVIT 0 FACE_LAST
IVIT 5 FACE_LAST
IVIT 3 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE IVIT IVIT
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank equal
        DEST Suit {SPADES}
    DESTSRC Rank add_13
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL IVIT Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL IVIT Empty
        PILE ALL IVIT Empty
